--verification-cache remembers the digest of each execution image in the cache directory, keyed by its path, size, times, device and inode, so a warm run no longer hashes the system's shared libraries in every process, and the cache key names paths under Dafny's, .NET's and the solver's installations by placeholder, so the same build in another directory reuses the cache. Both apply only when the option is given. See https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/261.
